{"id":626,"slug":"tabs-020","category_slug":"tabs","name":"可切换标签页","description":"点击切换面板","tags":["Tabs","交互","标签页","antd","扁平","Linear","极简"],"preview_html":"\n<div style=\"padding:20px\">\n  <div class=\"tabs-bar\" style=\"display:flex;gap:24px;border-bottom:1px solid #e8e8e8\" onclick=\"var bar=this;var idx=Array.prototype.indexOf.call(bar.children,event.target.closest('span'));if(idx<0)return;bar.querySelectorAll('span').forEach(function(s,i){s.style.color=i===idx?'#1677ff':'#666';s.style.borderBottom=i===idx?'2px solid #1677ff':'2px solid transparent'});var wrap=bar.parentNode;wrap.querySelectorAll('.pane').forEach(function(p,i){p.style.display=i===idx?'block':'none'})\">\n    <span style=\"padding:10px 0;color:#1677ff;border-bottom:2px solid #1677ff;font-size:14px;cursor:pointer\">概览</span>\n    <span style=\"padding:10px 0;color:#666;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;font-size:14px;cursor:pointer\">评论</span>\n    <span style=\"padding:10px 0;color:#666;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;font-size:14px;cursor:pointer\">设置</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pane\" style=\"padding:16px;font-size:13px;color:#666\">这是概览面板内容。</div>\n  <div class=\"pane\" style=\"padding:16px;font-size:13px;color:#666;display:none\">这是评论面板内容，共 12 条评论。</div>\n  <div class=\"pane\" style=\"padding:16px;font-size:13px;color:#666;display:none\">这是设置面板内容。</div>\n</div>","prompt":"设计可切换标签页：点击标签切换下划线高亮与对应面板内容。","prompt_short":"可切换标签页：点击切换面板 风格 Tabs / 交互 / 标签页 / antd","sort":10,"category_name":"标签页 Tabs","category_group":"导航与结构","prompt_refactor":"把现有页面里的「可切换标签页」改成这个观感，只改样式，不重写。\n\n技术栈：按我项目现有的（Vue / Quasar 或 React / Tailwind 均可），不要升级版本，不要引入新依赖。\n\n参照描述：\n设计可切换标签页：点击标签切换下划线高亮与对应面板内容。\n\n约束：\n1. props 名称、数据字段、组件层级一律不动，只调整布局 / 间距 / 字号 / 颜色 / 圆角 / 阴影\n2. 需要动效时用项目已有能力降级实现，不新增动画库\n3. 先给 2-3 个方向（每个方向改了什么、风险在哪），我确认后再出代码\n4. 出代码时给完整单文件版本，不要给 diff\n验收：功能不变，构建能过。风格关键词：Tabs / 交互 / 标签页 / antd / 扁平 / Linear","url":"/v/tabs-020/","md_url":"/api/v/tabs-020.md","related":[{"slug":"tabs-001","name":"antd Ta